# NEXT IAS Umang 2026 Cricket Tournament - Global Database Configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option A: Google Firebase Realtime Database (Recommended)
# Create a free project at https://console.firebase.google.com/
# Enable Realtime Database in test mode and paste the database URL below:
# VITE_FIREBASE_DB_URL=https://your-project-id-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com

# Option B: Custom Node Backend (Render.com / Railway)
# If you deploy server.js to Render or Railway, specify your HTTPS backend URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com/api
